  LOGIN RESULT: USER  proto=telnet  user=manager  seconds=0.2

  === CMD: show users ===
  Line    User            Host(s)  Idle      Location        Priv Idletime Timeout
  con 0   manager         idle     00:00:43  ttyS0           15   10       N/A
  vty 0   manager         idle     00:00:01  10.38.22.33     1    10       N/A

  === CMD: show telnet ===
